     {
      "title": "Software Engineer II - Amazon Music & AWS Config",
      "timePeriod": {
       "startDate": {
        "month": 10,
        "year": 2022
       },
       "endDate": null
      },
      "totalDuration": "4 yrs 2 mos",
      "description": "· Reduced API traffic by 80%, latency by 40%, and exceptions by 5%, improved the listening experience for millions of Amazon Music customers, saved curators time by automating manual processes, and received award by delivering new feature for highly curated flagship stations. \n· Tech lead from inception to successful launch of new service tier experience to millions of Amazon Music customers worldwide, demonstrating cross-team collaboration, prioritization skills, and grit, standing up a new testing framework, and managing full dev lifecycle across 3 services.\n· Improved listening by 15% and reduced latency by 5% as tech lead for ML model migration.\n· Tech lead for pre-launch org-wide feature (API updates across 5 services, enabled ML analysis).\n· Reduced incoming tickets by 7% by addressing root cause issues; number one ticket resolver for 2022, closing 244 tickets, which represents 23% of ticket volume on an 8 person team.\n· Designed and led security review for data feed service, which supports configuration items filtering, transformation, and delivery as part of the 2024 re:Invent service-linked recorder project, which supports the new AWS CloudWatch telemetry configurations audit. \n· Led AWS Config build and launch in multiple new isolated regions, partnered with Amazon Dedicated Cloud engineers during pre- and post-isolation. Identified and implemented region build automation improvements, resulting in significant reduction in build and launch time for future new partition builds. \n· Certified AWS Security Guardian & AWS Change Management Bar Raiser.\n· Support international customers (including Netflix & Meta) with assessing, auditing, and evaluating configurations of their cloud resources.\n· Serve on GovCloud/ITAR-specific on call rotations in addition to overall AWS Config Compliance on call rotation.",
      "insights": "Artificial Intelligence (AI)"
